      {
       "text": "Let us know if you encounter any issues or have any questions!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are also so grateful for all your support and passion, stonegrinders! We are thrilled to bring you this new update that hopefully gives you some extra motivation on your grind. See you on the leaderboards! ✨",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Read more about the new update here!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
