  {
   "id": "grindstone-124031@major-2022-07-29",
   "gameId": "grindstone-124031",
   "displayName": "The COSMIC DARKSIDE Grindstone Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-07-29T15:14:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "The Cosmic Darkside is here!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Grindstone just received a huge new update, and it's sure to challenge the most hardened stonegrinders.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Did you think your journey was over once reaching the summit of Grindstone Mountain? Think again! A meteor from behind the stars will tear open a hole to the Cosmic Darkside - pass through this portal to the Mystic's Realm, where new enemies, new challenges, new items, and 60 cosmic levels await.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(version number is v1.1.29-4284041r, for those looking to confirm their update)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Oh no, it's Osmium!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "There's trouble in the Mystic's Cosmic Realm, and it all starts with Osmium!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's nasty stuff! Once Osmium gets into something, it can cause all kinds of problems. The creeps you're used to slashing through, for example, become a bit tougher - and even worse, they'll eventually burst, spreading new osmium infections nearby! Not even grindstones are safe from infection, so be on guard!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Destroying an infected enemy will release a loose chunk of Osmium. Be sure to grab it quickly, before it has a chance to explode and spread even more infection.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Luckily, you can also use Osmium as a resource to craft powerful new gear - you're gonna need it!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Cosmic Features",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "New Game+ mode called the Cosmic Darkside (obvs)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New enemy types",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New hazard: new \"Osmium\" hazard",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New level objective: clear all osmium infection from Cosmic Darkside levels.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New category of gear: new Osmium-based weapons",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New outfit with ability: New Hazmat suit.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New cutscene animation: New Intro cutscene for the Cosmic Darkside.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Cosmic Darkside background music and ambience",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various Gameplay + bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "How to access",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The Cosmic Darkside unlocks after defeating level 200, at the end of the Lost Lair. Shortly after you've done this, a meteor will strike near the town of Hjellhole, at the base of the Mountain.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This meteor opens up a portal into the Mystic's Realm. Simply pass through this portal to access the new levels - good luck!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "The Cosmos are Growing...",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "This is just the beginning of your journey into the Cosmic Darkside! Stay tuned for future updates, as the cosmic infection spreads beyond these initial levels and into new biomes....",
